HUMAL:START:HUMABERRY:1000mm:>Pi
HUMAL:BOARD:HUMABERRY:ARCH:ORBITAL629:SATURNRINGCHAIN
HUMAL:FACTORY:
HUMAL:STATE:QUANTUM_BIO_LAB_ACTIVE
HUMAL:BIO:KONIKU:NEURON_SILICON:BREATH
HUMAL:BIO:YEAST:GLUCOSE:FERMENTATION:CO2
HUMAL:FORMULA:ACETONE_0.5_5ppm:NH3_0.1_2ppm
